      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">
        So, which should you choose?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        It isn't strictly either-or. A varied diet including a range of fermented
        foods is a sound approach, and we'd never tell you to drop kefir or
        sauerkraut. Capsules have their place too, particularly for convenience and
        travel.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        What we offer is the combination neither of them gives you: named,
        research-studied strains, delivered complete and fresh, in stated quantity, made
        days rather than months before you drink it. If that's what you've been
        looking for, you can read more about the strains on our
        <a href="/about" class="underline hover:text-amber-500 transition">about page</a>
        or browse the range in our
        <a href="/shop" class="underline hover:text-amber-500 transition">shop</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        This page is educational information only and is not medical advice. It
